{"2826510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DRIFT BOOM BOOM", "steam_appid": 2826510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/26c64ef8251cec5c2f0763718a91b303.avif?t=1770415852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras_big/26c64ef8251cec5c2f0763718a91b303.avif?t=1770415852 width=1560 height=1204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DRIFT! </i> Your way around <strong>40+ Race Courses</strong> and hours of chaotic <strong>Story Mode </strong>levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BOOM! </i> Use your winnings to <strong>Purchase Upgrades</strong>, Weapons, and precious Ammunition </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BOOM!</i>  <strong>Crash and shoot</strong> anyone who gets in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Splitscreen Racing</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1-4 players in all game modes.  <strong>Cooperate or Compete</strong> with your friends &amp; family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.poster.avif?t=1770415852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.webm?t=1770415852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.mp4?t=1770415852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Win races and blow up the competition to earn cash.  Spend cash on new weapons and upgrade.  Work your way up against harder and harder AI opponents!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Story Mode (Up to 4 players)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a rookie Agent assigned to dismantle a crime ring in a small rural town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore town, make friends, and <strong>Catch the Scum Lord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/0c689f99d6bd60fd45e3a4ad05cee9dd.avif?t=1770415852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras_big/0c689f99d6bd60fd45e3a4ad05cee9dd.avif?t=1770415852 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Tight Controls</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple enough to <strong>Pick Up &amp; Play</strong>.  Deep enough to reward skilled maneuvers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.poster.avif?t=1770415852\" width=668 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.webm?t=1770415852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.mp4?t=1770415852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 retro concept cars, each with <strong>Distinct feel</strong> and stats<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/8644666203ca876d013b3370e8b26376.avif?t=1770415852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras_big/